// Movement abilities given by equipment (which pieces give them: the stats
// strata:air_jumps, strata:dash and strata:climb). Speeds in blocks per second, times in
// ticks (20 a second). The world option « Movement from equipment » turns them off.
Mobility(
    air_jump_speed: 7.6,
    dash_speed: 14.0,
    dash_ticks: 4,
    dash_cooldown: 30,
    climb_speed: 2.4,
)
